   "description": "[BR-CRM-002] The ERPNext user Sarvam's voice agent authenticates as for every call (reads/writes to zap.sravie.in, directly or via the zap-crm MCP connector). caller_gate's server-side enforcement (the CRM Lead/Contact/Customer/CRM Deal/Quotation/FCRM Note validate hook, and the matching read restrictions) is scoped to this user only - a staff member's own session is never affected, whatever is set here. Leave blank to disable caller-gate enforcement entirely.",
